# Copy to .env for local development, or set in Netlify > Site settings >
# Environment variables for a deployed build.
#
# URL of the FastAPI backend (WITHOUT a trailing slash). The frontend appends
# "/api" automatically. Leave empty for a frontend-only deploy — the admin
# panel, chatbot and contact form will simply stay inactive, but the whole
# marketing site (services, projects, pricing, etc.) still renders.
#
# Example (backend on Render):
# REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=https://agastya-backend.onrender.com
REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=
